{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":40,"ref":"1-chronicles 7:40","book":"1-chronicles","lang":"de","chapter":7,"translation":"Alle diese waren Söhne Aschers, Häupter der Vaterhäuser, Ausgelesene, Kämpfer der Kriegskraft, Häupter der Fürsten. Und ihre Eintragung ⟨erfolgte⟩ in der Heeresrolle ⟨für⟩ den Kriegsdienst. Ihre Zahl ⟨betrug⟩ an Männern sechsundzwanzigtausend.","tokens":[{"surface":"כל","gloss":"Alle"},{"surface":"אלה","gloss":"diese"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"waren Söhne"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"Aschers"},{"surface":"ראשי","gloss":"Häupter"},{"surface":"בית","gloss":"der Vaterhäuser,"},{"surface":"האבות","gloss":"der Vaterhäuser,"},{"surface":"ברורים","gloss":"Ausgelesene,"},{"surface":"גבורי","gloss":"Kämpfer"},{"surface":"חילים","gloss":"der Kriegskraft,"},{"surface":"ראשי","gloss":"Häupter"},{"surface":"הנשיאים","gloss":"der Fürsten."},{"surface":"והתיחשם","gloss":"Und ihre Eintragung"},{"surface":"בצבא","gloss":"in der Heeresrolle"},{"surface":"במלחמה","gloss":"den Kriegsdienst."},{"surface":"מספרם","gloss":"Ihre Zahl"},{"surface":"אנשים","gloss":"an Männern"},{"surface":"עשרים","gloss":"zwanzig"},{"surface":"וששה","gloss":"und sechs"},{"surface":"אלף","gloss":"tausend"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-05T23:48:13.779625329Z","model":"glm-5.2"}